        "user": "Please analyze this document and provide a structured summary:\n\n{{#'2-2'.text#}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "type": "template",
      "param": {
        "variables": [["summaries", ["output", "2"]]],
        "template": "# Document Analysis Summary\n\nThe following documents were analyzed:\n\n{% for summary in summaries %}\n## Document {{loop.index}}\n{{summary}}\n\n---\n\n{% endfor %}\n\n## Combined Summary\n\nThe above documents have been comprehensively analyzed. Each document's structure has been parsed, key sections identified, and main points summarized. The individual summaries provide detailed insights into each document's content and purpose."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "markdown-exporter",
      "param": {
        "target_type": "docx",
        "md_text": "{{#'3'.output#}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "type": "end",
      "param": {
        "outputs": [
          ["summary", ["output", "3"]],
          ["docx_file", ["files", "4"]]
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
