        "user": "Create detailed content for the following chapter:\n\n**Chapter Title**: {{#5.item.title#}}\n**Description**: {{#5.item.description#}}\n**Learning Field**: {{#2.learning_field#}}\n**Learning Goals**: {{#2.learning_goals#}}\n\nPlease provide:\n1. **Core Knowledge Points** (3-5 key concepts)\n2. **Detailed Explanation** for each concept\n3. **Rich Examples** (2-3 practical examples per concept)\n4. **Pros and Cons Analysis** for techniques/methods discussed\n5. **Important Precautions** and common pitfalls\n6. **Practice Exercises** (2-3 hands-on activities)\n\nFormat everything in Markdown with clear headers and bullet points."
